  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融產業專業實習導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO FINANCIAL INDUSTRY INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程希望協助同學對金融產業特性與金融機構（銀行業、證券業與保險業）能有基本的認知；同時，也希望透過本課程將金融專業實習與其相關業務介紹給同學。",
    "describe_eh": "The objective of this course is to help students to learn about characteristics of financial industry and introduction of financial institutions. Moreover, this course also introduces important information regarding financial professional practice and related businesses to students.",
